        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ji̱ tɛ̈r diaal näk däär dɔaar guäth ëë ca kɛ juɔ̱ɔ̱c thi̱n ɛ ji̱ tɛ̈riɛn. Kɛ kɔrɛ cukɛ ben Aay kä cukɛ nɛy diaal tin ŋot thi̱n ben ŋɛ̈r piny kɛ thɛp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ pa̱ny cua nɛy ti bathdɔɔri wäl wi̱cdiɛn rɛw lap piny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö /ken Jɔ-cua tetdɛ luɔ̱ɔ̱c piny amäni mëë ci nɛy diaal thuuk kɛ lia̱a̱ kä Aay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ ni ɣɔ̱k kärɔ̱ kɛnɛ kuak wec ɛmɔ tëë cua ka̱n ala nyinkiɛn tin pɛ̈ɛ̈c nikɛ mëë ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱r Jɔ-cua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn inɔ, cu Jɔ-cua Aay cua̱th, kä cuɛ jɛ jak kä di̱r dhiac. Ɛ jɛn ta̱a̱dɛ min ŋot thi̱n amäni täämɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ kuäär Aay in di̱i̱t ŋap jiaath kä cuɛ ri̱i̱ŋdɛ jak kä but thi̱n amäni thiaŋ. Kä guäth in kony kɛ cäŋ, cuɛ naath jiök ba jɛ woc, kä cua jɛ yuɔr piny thok rɛ̈ɛ̈k wec kä cukɛ jɛ buɔ̱th piny kɛ buɔ̱n päämni mi di̱i̱t mi ŋot thi̱n amäni täämɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuën buɔk ŋuɔ̱tni wi̱i̱ Pa̱a̱m Ee-bal",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu Jɔ-cua Kuoth Nhial ni Kuoth ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ku ta̱th yi̱k wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m Ee-bal ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ce̱tnikɛ mëë ci Muthɛ in la kuany Kuɔth Nhial ɛ la̱r gaat I-thɛ-rɛl i̱ ba la̱t, ce̱tnikɛ min ca gɔ̱r rɛy Buɔk Ŋuɔ̱tni Muthɛ i̱, “Yi̱k mi ca täth kɛ pääm ti /ka̱n kuac kä /ka̱n jɔp kɛ yieeth.” Kä cukɛ muc ti waaŋ thöp Kuoth Nhial wi̱i̱dɛ, kä cukɛ jɛ nääk kä ɣɔ̱k ti muc kɛ kui̱ miɛth nyuaakädiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn wani nhiam ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, cu Jɔ-cua ruac mi te rɛy buɔk ŋuɔ̱tni Muthɛ gɔ̱a̱r puɔ̱ɔ̱ny päämni tɔ̱tɔ̱, jɛn ruac ëë ci Muthɛ ɛ lat kɛ kui̱ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal kɛɛl kɛ gaat tutnikiɛn, kɛ kua̱r lätnikiɛn, kɛ ruëëckiɛn amäni jur tëë te rɛydiɛn, cukɛ cuɔ̱ŋ kui̱cni thanduɔ̱k matdä Kuɔth da̱ŋ rɛw, te bööth palä kä ji̱ Lii-bay tëë kapkɛ jɛ dääriɛn. Ci tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn jɔkdiɛn riet pa̱a̱m Gɛ-ri-dhim kɛnɛ tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn pa̱a̱m Ee-bal. Nɛmɛ ɛ mëë ci Muthɛ in la kuany Kuɔth Nhial ɛ lar i̱ ba la̱t mi wä gua̱a̱th in ba poth nikɛ cop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn, cu Jɔ-cua ŋuɔ̱t diaal ku kuen kɛ, ruaacni puthä kɛnɛ bit diaal, nikɛ ta̱a̱ in ca gɔ̱ɔ̱r nikɛ rɛy buɔk ŋuɔ̱tni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn ŋuɔ̱t diaal tëë ci Muthɛ kɛ gɔ̱r, cu Jɔ-cua kɛ kuen ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal tëë ci duɔl, kɛ män kɛ gaat amäni jur tëë te rɛydiɛn. Thilɛ riet kɛl mi cuɛ ba̱ny jɔ̱ɔ̱r.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
